> Module 7 — THE BATHROOM MODULE. The most mundanely humiliating module yet. Leo learning to pee sitting down, discovering where the urethra actually is, the front-to-back wiping rule, the difference between moisture types. Ava learning to aim, having to HOLD it, the sensation cascade, foreskin hygiene, the horrified face at the bowl-rim tuck explanation. Privacy screens up. Audio shared. Every clinical instruction landing on two people who thought using the bathroom was the one thing they'd never have to relearn. Let's make it excruciatingly real.

