> Module 14 — ENVIRONMENTAL AWARENESS. The city module. The map. Safe zones, danger zones, the emergency beacon, partner tethering. After thirteen modules of body-focused clinical instruction, the system finally turns outward — showing them the world they're about to walk into. The city unfreezes. The rain falls. The hover lanes resume. And two people in new bodies get their first real look at the playground and the minefield they're locked inside until the questline is done. Lighter module — tactical, informational, a breather before the final emotional calibration of Module 15. Let's make the city feel alive and vast and waiting.

